    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Prepare For Trouble, And Make It Double.</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;It's been a while since the war ended and while Etheria had healed from it's scars, Catra finds herself struggling to do the same. Never one fond of healthy coping mechanisms, Catra turns to the one person who can imitate the person she craves in her hour of need. Double-Trouble. But that moment of weakness comes with a price, one with a high risk that ends up being a high reward.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;br /&gt;Or: Catra assumes Adora and Scorpia are now a thing and she relies on a certain shapeshifter to stay with her for a night and shift into the one person she's convinced herself she'll never be worthy of.  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Or x2: Adora walks in on Catra in bed with her clone, and after an awkward confrontation, something amazing ensues.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(Oh and there's some minor filler of Glimmer and Adora both playing wingman to coach Scorpia on how to get closer with Perfuma so yeah, there's that to look forward to too lol.)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
